    {
      "name": "Massive",
      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "EFSqCFPCcW4bIcdI",
      "img": "modules/daggerheart-scifi-content/artwork/icons/abilities/blue-ancient-armor.webp",
      "system": {
        "attribution": {},
        "description": "<p>Unless <em>Vulnerable</em>, this vehicle is immune to damage from attacks by creatures or vehicles without the <strong>Massive</strong> feature.</p><ul><li><p>If attacked by another <strong>Massive</strong> vehicle or creature, it suffers damage normally.</p></li><li><p>When this vehicle makes an attack against a target without this feature, that target must <strong>mark an Armor Slot</strong> without receiving its benefits (though they may still use armor to reduce damage).</p></li><li><p>If they cannot mark an Armor Slot, they must instead <strong>mark an additional HP</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
